Subject: [PATCH] Add realtime audio capture, streaming sources and Opus voice
 codec

Adds IRealtimeAudioManager (ALC microphone capture + streaming PCM sources)
and a managed Opus voice encoder/decoder backed by Concentus (BSD-3-Clause),
so content can implement voice chat without access to OpenAL internals.

